 "method": "Gyropup's literal STEPS (titles, parts, insertion offsets, camera directions and instruction text) copied in order; each scene mesh translated from its group's frame into the neutral pose (zero pan and tilt, mounting face at z = 0), triangles unchanged, then packed by cad-agent's pack_view into one cad-agent-model/1 model (welded, quantised to 16-bit steps across the turret's box). No CAD is imported, rebuilt or simplified, and no vendor source CAD is read or shipped: the scene's bought parts are Gyropup's own envelope meshes. Instruction text: the text_rules below, every edit listed under text_edits with its position; undoing them restores the original, whose SHA-256 is recorded.",
